ked Vial Recovered',53040),(445144,78931,0,5,7,213714,1,28,0,0,'Blacksmith Hammer Recovered',53040),(445145,78931,15,6,-1,0,1,0,0,0,'Recover the Items',53040),(445146,78931,0,7,3,213279,4,92,0,33,'Item 1 Recovered',53040),(445147,78931,0,8,4,213293,4,92,0,33,'Item 2 Recovered',53040),(445148,78931,0,9,5,213281,3,92,0,34,'Notable Item 1 Recovered',53040),(445149,78931,0,10,8,213713,3,92,0,34,'Notable Item 2 Recovered',53040),(445150,78931,0,11,9,213714,3,92,0,34,'Notable Item 3 Recovered',53040),(445194,78332,0,0,3,213498,1,4,0,0,'Use O.D.I.E.\'s Remote Control near the Trade District Fountain',54630),(445335,78931,0,2,10,214515,1,28,0,0,'Notable Item (Any) Recovered',53040),(445493,78328,0,5,6,213262,1,0,0,0,'Ying met',54630),(445599,78329,0,0,0,215197,1,4,0,0,'Portal taken to the Gala of Gifts',54630),(445601,78981,0,0,0,215196,1,28,0,0,'[DNT] Arch glow',54630),(445620,76734,0,0,5,215282,1,0,0,0,'Speak with Coalo',53040);
INSERT  IGNORE INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES (47512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The swamp of Nazmir represents the largest threat to my people. I am glad you chose to help me in this.',45745),(47514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My father\'s trust is not easily earned.$b$bBelieve me.',38134),(51800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You have chosen to set sail for Tiragarde Sound.>',45745),(55660,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good luck!',44908),(57531,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is it? Are you sure there wasn\'t more?',43206),(58603,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Phaestus returns! Glorious day.\n\nMany thanks, friend. This hammer has been passed down for eons! It belongs in my masterful hands.',43206),(59910,669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This place is mired with atrocities. They must be purged.',37176),(60114,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could hear their cries from here. Nice work!',37176),(60129,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Could it be? An actual mortal being in the Eternal City? The Purpose be served!',41488),(60218,669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are worthy of Bastion\'s grace, $n. May it serve you well.',36710),(64592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have archived the necessary records. Thank you for your assistance.',42538),(64644,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A small opening in the creature looks like the perfect size for a little pour of mystical water.>',42698),(64645,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'On to the Foundry.',42698),(64646,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These automa should not act like this.\n\nThey are beautiful. Strange. New.\n\nWe must deliberate before continuing.',42698),(64647,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Koh Shira examines the piece of the automa--entwined with living vines.>\n\nThis cannot be.\n\nAutoma do not have vines within them. But these automa do.\n\nThis... is beautiful.',42698),(64648,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Learning about new creatures that are infused with living growth--well, that sounds right up my alley! \n\nI think I\'ll stay with them and see how I can help... and maybe pick up their language as well. \n\nThanks for coming on this adventure with me, friend!',42698),(64739,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is worse than I thought. Much worse.',42538),(64745,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This automa still lives! But it is so weak.',42698),(64759,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope this will encourage our friend here to view us as an ally. First Ones forgive us.',42698),(64761,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This lonely one will be strong again.',42698),(64762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Support has arrived. The restoration may commence.',42698),(64767,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I should have obeyed the elders! This is all my fault!',42698),(64772,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for finding the survivors!',42538),(64775,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A new type of devourer. Troubling. Hopefully these are the only ones.\n\nAs for this mysterious metal... I have seen it before.',42538),(64778,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This information will help us. Tell us how to close the rifts. Fewer rifts means fewer devourers.',42538),(64779,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is the flesh $n gathered? \n\n<The jiro sorts through the gooping mass of meat.>\n\nIt will have to do.',42538),(64780,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Removing mawsteel prevents rifts. It is not much but it will help.',42538),(64829,6,1,0,0,0,300,0,0,'Even now, this place is beautiful.',42560),(64854,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This information will help us continue to unravel the mysteries of Zereth Mortis.',42560),(64964,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work.',42698),(65219,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Devourers have been repelled. For now. But they will return.\n\nOne day, we will remove them forever. I will stay to defend the jiro until then.\n\nThis could not have been done without you. You have my deepest gratitude.',42538),(65268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That is enough for now, thank you.',42698),(65363,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Order has been restored. Thank you for your assistance.',42698),(65364,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Order has been restored. We thank you for your assistance.',42560),(65420,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tahli is alive? And you preserved an automa archive with her help?! Oh, my. That is... a lot to take in.\n\nAnd, of course, her guilt has prevented her from returning home. Oh, Tahli.',42698),(65426,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, Architect.',42698),(65427,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Success. \n\nThe Protoform Repository is now restored.',42698),(65433,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A strange energy surrounds the console.>',42488),(65445,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have completed the task. Thank you for your assistance.',42698),(65700,669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pocopoc is most intriguing, yes? I do wonder the extent of its capabilities.',42488),(65729,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $p. Let us see if this produces results.',42560),(66649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Once again, you are met with something you do not understand. This time you do not question why. The journey has been its own reward. This is merely a means to remember it.>',45338),(66650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You are ready. As the air changes ever so slightly, you reach out and close your hand. Within seconds, you feel it appear. You don\'t look for your prize this time, the two of you exist in perfect harmony.>',45338),(66661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That coin... no one in Oribos will take its kind, and I doubt you\'d survive the trip to the market that could. If I may be so bold, perhaps my associates and I could provide assistance?',45114),(75681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',51886),(76114,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hope ye like this month\'s collection of new and exotic wares, $n.',53262),(78328,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aren\'t the wares just marvelous? I find myself just a little jealous of the talent--and I find it hard to resist picking up everything they\'ve made!\n\nDid anything catch your eye?',53262);
INSERT  IGNORE INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `EmoteOnCompleteDelay`, `EmoteOnIncompleteDelay`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES (78328,0,1,0,0,'Have you seen all of the wares available?',53262);
INSERT  IGNORE INTO `quest_offer_reward_conditional` (`QuestId`, `PlayerConditionId`, `QuestgiverCreatureId`, `locale`, `Text`, `OrderIndex`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES (76114,923,185472,'enUS','Hope ya like this month\'s collection of new and exotic wares, $n.',0,53262);
INSERT  IGNORE INTO `quest_description_conditional` (`QuestId`, `PlayerConditionId`, `QuestgiverCreatureId`, `locale`, `Text`, `OrderIndex`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES (76114,923,0,'enUS','<The glint of a distant object catches your eye. You suddenly remember that you have tender to collect for use at Zen\'shiri Trading Post.>',0,54630),(78329,0,215197,'enUS','Hey there friend! Do you like gifts? How about flowers? Food? Chocolate? Vacations to scenic lands?\n\nOh, I\'m getting ahead of myself! Come to the Gala of Gifts, where all this and more is yours!\n\nI can take you there with this portal. Just touch it and imagine being surrounded by love!',0,54630),(78332,114725,38066,'enUS','$n! Boy am I glad to see you.\n\nListen $n, we may have gotten rid of the Crown Chemical Co., but I got a bad feeling we haven\'t seen the last of them.\n\nWell, take a look at my pal here. Sure, he looks like a pooch, but this is O.D.I.E.! The Olfactory Detection and Inspection Engine! With this little fella, you and I can sniff out whatever the Crown is plotting from a mile away!\n\nWhat do you say, partners again?',0,54630),(78981,0,215196,'enUS','Do you appreciate gifts, flowers, and food? How about vacations to beautiful, distant lands?\n\nCome to the Gala of Gifts! There are roses aplenty and chocolates galore!\n\nMy portal will take you there. Simply touch it and imagine your heart\'s desire!',0,54630);
